### List all sprints (includes the seeded "Sprint 1" / "Sprint 2")
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sprints

### Create a sprint
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sprints
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sprint 3",
  "startDate": "2026-11-01",
  "endDate": "2026-11-14"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("newSprintId", response.body.id);
%}

### Get the sprint back by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sprints/{{newSprintId}}

### EXERCISE E demo - sprint statistics (501 until implemented)
# Replace 1 with the id of the seeded "Sprint 1" if it differs on your machine.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sprints/1/statistics

### EXERCISE F demo - close a sprint and move its unfinished tickets to the next one (501 until implemented)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sprints/1/close
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nextSprintId": 2
}
